; One variable: a set text direction on trimmed outlined text. LinkButton, the FoldableContainer
; title and Button each draw Hebrew and Latin rows set LTR (1) and RTL (2), with a red
; outline_size 8 ring. A set direction is the paragraph direction, so ring and fill trim and draw
; alike (text_server.cpp:1744,1840). The AUTO rows are in unit-text-outline-link-foldable-item-list.

